{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254620/extras/cdcf688c47d6b5f58a080965836018cb.avif?t=1740428114\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254620/extras_big/cdcf688c47d6b5f58a080965836018cb.avif?t=1740428114 width=800 height=533 /></span>Old Magic Grandtower is a 2 player coop puzzle adventure game, combining tactical floor-breaking combat against fairy-tale creatures with challenging puzzles on every floor.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Floor-breaking combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight on a crumbling tower floor where every skill matters - break, push, pull, and outmaneuver your enemies to send them plunging into the void below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254620/extras/f325605d046e776fc604e8765eba7f8a.avif?t=1740428114\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254620/extras_big/f325605d046e776fc604e8765eba7f8a.avif?t=1740428114 width=800 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Navigate intricate puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve challenging puzzles that require clever teamwork - combine both heroes' unique abilities to overcome obstacles and ascend the Tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254620/extras/52756915a27539e14863d1a1e65d295b.avif?t=1740428114\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254620/extras_big/52756915a27539e14863d1a1e65d295b.avif?t=1740428114 width=800 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Stained Spire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main goal is to reach the top of the Old Tower, uncovering the dark secrets within and discovering the origins of the Ink Apocalypse that shattered the fairy-tale world 30 years ago.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlikely Allies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Red Riding Hood and the Big Bad Wolf, both forever changed by the years following the Ink Apocalypse. Red, a war-hardened veteran struggling with PTSD, joins forces with the Wolf, who's grown weary of his villainous reputation and seeks to forge his own path through humanity.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3254620?t=1740428114","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254620/66aecbbd99db09783f10e5b601fb0b431733b217/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740428114","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254620/b194146fbad7f121b658a1d7756df14376158de3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740428114","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254620/b194146fbad7f121b658a1d7756df14376158de3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740428114","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3546850,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254620/extras/cdcf688c47d6b5f58a080965836018cb.avif?t=1740428114\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254620/extras_big/cdcf688c47d6b5f58a080965836018cb.avif?t=1740428114 width=800 height=533 /></span>Old Magic Grandtower is a 2 player coop puzzle adventure game, combining tactical floor-breaking combat against fairy-tale creatures with challenging puzzles on every floor.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Floor-breaking combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight on a crumbling tower floor where every skill matters - break, push, pull, and outmaneuver your enemies to send them plunging into the void below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254620/extras/f325605d046e776fc604e8765eba7f8a.avif?t=1740428114\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254620/extras_big/f325605d046e776fc604e8765eba7f8a.avif?t=1740428114 width=800 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Navigate intricate puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve challenging puzzles that require clever teamwork - combine both heroes' unique abilities to overcome obstacles and ascend the Tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254620/extras/52756915a27539e14863d1a1e65d295b.avif?t=1740428114\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254620/extras_big/52756915a27539e14863d1a1e65d295b.avif?t=1740428114 width=800 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Stained Spire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main goal is to reach the top of the Old Tower, uncovering the dark secrets within and discovering the origins of the Ink Apocalypse that shattered the fairy-tale world 30 years ago.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlikely Allies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Red Riding Hood and the Big Bad Wolf, both forever changed by the years following the Ink Apocalypse. Red, a war-hardened veteran struggling with PTSD, joins forces with the Wolf, who's grown weary of his villainous reputation and seeks to forge his own path through humanity.</p>","developers":["M44 Labs"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254620/header.jpg?t=1740428114","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All supporting materials and proprietary business information are the property of Roman Maevskiy.<br />\r\nThese materials may only be altered, shared or reproduced with the explicit consent or at the request of copyright owners.<br />\r\nSport Rock & Workout | HARD by Alex-Productions | https://onsound.eu/ Music promoted by https://www.chosic.com/free-music/all/ Creative Commons CC BY 3.0 https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3254620/831946/d49f38d40959eb978610d79537297c2516097447/1750885011/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740428112","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3254620/831946/d49f38d40959eb978610d79537297c2516097447/1750885011/dash_h264.mpd?t=1740428112","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3254620/831946/d49f38d40959eb978610d79537297c2516097447/1750885011/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1740428112","id":257100153,"name":"OMGDEMOTARailer1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257100153/07e959c4f05d2e8cbfc84c0636b7b49e3c1b8141/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740428112"}],"name":"Old Magic Grandtower","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-b